   "briefTitle": "A Multiple Dose Comparison of Tiotropium Inhalation Capsules and Salmeterol Inhalation Aerosol.",
   "officialTitle": "A Multiple Dose Comparison of Tiotropium Inhalation Capsules and Salmeterol Inhalation Aerosol in a 12 Week, Randomized, Double-Blind, Double-Dummy Parallel Group Study in Patients With Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD)."
