  "descriptionModule": {
   "briefSummary": "The objective of the study was to evaluate the degree of improvement in lung function in patients with chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD) after treatment with tiotropium inhalation capsules compared to salmeterol inhalation aerosol ."
  },
